(4667738, 673847, 80458, '<td valign="top">i really dont feel that this meets the challenge, but i''m going to vote on it as if it did because i suppose you could ''stretch'' it to fit the theme. I just wouldnt classify vitamins and pills as health foods. They''re things that keep you healthy, but you could also lump exercise and not smoking into this category and it wouldnt meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>As for the photo - really nice colors and texture. I think you captured the subject very well.</td>', 'i really dont feel that this meets the challenge, but i''m going to vote on it as if it did because i suppose you could ''stretch'' it to fit the theme. I just wouldnt classify vitamins and pills as health foods. They''re things that keep you healthy, but you could also lump exercise and not smoking into this category and it wouldnt meet the challenge. As for the photo - really nice colors and texture. I think you captured the subject very well.', '2008-04-30 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
