(4668013, 674226, 76430, '<td valign="top">A look of shock and horror.  I love it!  Nice layout of the food.  However the sushi looks a bit dull.  Maybe a little more lights or PP lightening would have helped.</td>', 'A look of shock and horror.  I love it!  Nice layout of the food.  However the sushi looks a bit dull.  Maybe a little more lights or PP lightening would have helped.', '2008-04-30 14:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668020, 672828, 30049, '<td valign="top">The front sprigs are a nice touch.  The salad is "ok"...something about the image is lacking a wow factor.  Maybe it''s the reflections on the glass bowl?  It''s not a "bad" photo, just not very "exciting/interesting".  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The front sprigs are a nice touch.  The salad is "ok"...something about the image is lacking a wow factor.  Maybe it''s the reflections on the glass bowl?  It''s not a "bad" photo, just not very "exciting/interesting".  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-30 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668031, 673554, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  Lighting is quite harsh.  At this distance from the subject, the sprigs in the back half should be in focus also IMO.  Line in the upper right, behind the table, is a distraction (move the table on change the POV).  Max size allowed for challenges is 640; you didn''t use all of it?</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  Lighting is quite harsh.  At this distance from the subject, the sprigs in the back half should be in focus also IMO.  Line in the upper right, behind the table, is a distraction (move the table on change the POV).  Max size allowed for challenges is 640; you didn''t use all of it?', '2008-04-30 14:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668041, 674192, 30049, '<td valign="top">What are the pills for?  Texture of the towel is distracting.  The "food" is nearly dry...I''d make it very wet for better impact I think.  Maybe on a white cutting board or something?  Just a thought.</td>', 'What are the pills for?  Texture of the towel is distracting.  The "food" is nearly dry...I''d make it very wet for better impact I think.  Maybe on a white cutting board or something?  Just a thought.', '2008-04-30 14:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668044, 673925, 30049, '<td valign="top">Missed on the focal point.  The bottom edge of the container and the back wall are sharp, the sprouts (whatever you call them) are OOF.  Not sure how you can make this particular food product interesting.  Maybe more of a closeup for some detail?  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Missed on the focal point.  The bottom edge of the container and the back wall are sharp, the sprouts (whatever you call them) are OOF.  Not sure how you can make this particular food product interesting.  Maybe more of a closeup for some detail?  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-30 14:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668047, 672754, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice approach.  Ok, so it''s a "simple" shot, very stock photo-ish...but I like it.  :-)  Sharp with good detail.  I also like how the near-side fork tines are reflecting back red.  Probably should have tried to minimize/eliminate the shadows some.  Overall nicely done.</td>', 'Nice approach.  Ok, so it''s a "simple" shot, very stock photo-ish...but I like it.  :-)  Sharp with good detail.  I also like how the near-side fork tines are reflecting back red.  Probably should have tried to minimize/eliminate the shadows some.  Overall nicely done.', '2008-04-30 14:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668050, 673807, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  A salad image that''s pretty well done.  I like the tongs coming into the image with the complimenting lower bowl.  Lighting may be a tad harsh on the lower bowl and greens.  Would like the bg to be whiter...looks yellowish.  Overall, nicely done.</td>', 'Yeah!  A salad image that''s pretty well done.  I like the tongs coming into the image with the complimenting lower bowl.  Lighting may be a tad harsh on the lower bowl and greens.  Would like the bg to be whiter...looks yellowish.  Overall, nicely done.', '2008-04-30 14:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668052, 674300, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the subject/food choice overall.  The yellow tint of the bg is killing this for me.  The clear dishes with a white (heck, I''d even try black just to see) bg might be more appealing.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the subject/food choice overall.  The yellow tint of the bg is killing this for me.  The clear dishes with a white (heck, I''d even try black just to see) bg might be more appealing.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-30 14:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668053, 674590, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice pleasing arrangement.  DOF is good.  I think I''d like a bit more lighting on the front, but overall well done.  Good luck!</td>', 'A nice pleasing arrangement.  DOF is good.  I think I''d like a bit more lighting on the front, but overall well done.  Good luck!', '2008-04-30 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
