(4668066, 674431, 30049, '<td valign="top">So, how fast did you have to eat that apple to keep the whole thing from yellowing?  :-)  I like the concept.  Execution of the layout is "ok".  Something feels not quite right.  Color of the bg?  Item used for placing the apple and weekly pill holder?  Maybe it''s because the apple is centered and the pill box makes it feel lopsided on the right?  Sorry...wish I could pinpoint what doesn''t feel "right" about this for me.  It''s not "bad", just not "great" either.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'So, how fast did you have to eat that apple to keep the whole thing from yellowing?  :-)  I like the concept.  Execution of the layout is "ok".  Something feels not quite right.  Color of the bg?  Item used for placing the apple and weekly pill holder?  Maybe it''s because the apple is centered and the pill box makes it feel lopsided on the right?  Sorry...wish I could pinpoint what doesn''t feel "right" about this for me.  It''s not "bad", just not "great" either.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-30 14:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
