(4668959, 674173, 91805, '<td valign="top">You should have either a slower or faster shutter speed.  The one you just makes the knife look blurry, it doesn''t convey motion enough.</td>', 'You should have either a slower or faster shutter speed.  The one you just makes the knife look blurry, it doesn''t convey motion enough.', '2008-04-30 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669012, 674226, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is my number two.  The expression of the fish is priceless.  Good idea - takes it above the average food shot.</td>', 'This is my number two.  The expression of the fish is priceless.  Good idea - takes it above the average food shot.', '2008-04-30 20:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669014, 673825, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is in my top three.  I love the out of focus elements in the background.  They add a lot to the image.  This would not look out of place at all in a food magazine.</td>', 'This is in my top three.  I love the out of focus elements in the background.  They add a lot to the image.  This would not look out of place at all in a food magazine.', '2008-04-30 20:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669018, 673648, 36382, '<td valign="top">The food looks very appetizing.  I like what you did with the color of the background and the napkins.  The only part I''m not sure about is the white candle? at the top.</td>', 'The food looks very appetizing.  I like what you did with the color of the background and the napkins.  The only part I''m not sure about is the white candle? at the top.', '2008-04-30 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669019, 674420, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good.  I like the red.  Simple and well done.</td>', 'Good.  I like the red.  Simple and well done.', '2008-04-30 20:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669020, 674331, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  Would like to see a bit more saturation.</td>', 'I like the composition.  Would like to see a bit more saturation.', '2008-04-30 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669065, 673554, 33068, '<td valign="top">I wish the shadow wasn''t in the pic otherwise a nice presentation.</td>', 'I wish the shadow wasn''t in the pic otherwise a nice presentation.', '2008-04-30 20:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669099, 673952, 92034, '<td valign="top">this is very unique</td>', 'this is very unique', '2008-04-30 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669102, 672725, 92034, '<td valign="top">very good idea, great color  9</td>', 'very good idea, great color  9', '2008-04-30 21:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669139, 673631, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of strawberries, but your image makes them look quite tasty. Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of strawberries, but your image makes them look quite tasty. Good lighting and composition.', '2008-04-30 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669141, 674112, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. The lighting seems just a little bit too harsh to me. Good use of black &amp; white though. 7</td>', 'I like your composition. The lighting seems just a little bit too harsh to me. Good use of black & white though. 7', '2008-04-30 22:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669145, 674181, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, colorful composition. Perhaps a little bit different lighting or a more solid black background would have made your image pop even more. Well done.</td>', 'Nice, colorful composition. Perhaps a little bit different lighting or a more solid black background would have made your image pop even more. Well done.', '2008-04-30 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669148, 674349, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first impression was a little alien food creature with asparagus arms. :-) Nice composition. and lighting.</td>', 'My first impression was a little alien food creature with asparagus arms. :-) Nice composition. and lighting.', '2008-04-30 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669149, 672883, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting seems just a bit too harsh along his neck and face, but great capture on the expression and good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'For me, the lighting seems just a bit too harsh along his neck and face, but great capture on the expression and good idea for the challenge.', '2008-04-30 22:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669150, 674547, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and composition. For me, if the lighting were a bit different or maybe if the image was a bit sharper over all, it would be even better.</td>', 'I like your idea and composition. For me, if the lighting were a bit different or maybe if the image was a bit sharper over all, it would be even better.', '2008-04-30 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669153, 673925, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the background detracts from your main subject. Perhaps a different angle or better focus on the sprouts themselves would make your photo work better.</td>', 'For me, the background detracts from your main subject. Perhaps a different angle or better focus on the sprouts themselves would make your photo work better.', '2008-04-30 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669154, 672828, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the salad. The first thing my eyes sees is the cheese. For me, I wish there was either more of the bowl or that the bottom green wasn''t cut off. Well done overall though. 6</td>', 'I like the colors of the salad. The first thing my eyes sees is the cheese. For me, I wish there was either more of the bowl or that the bottom green wasn''t cut off. Well done overall though. 6', '2008-04-30 22:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669155, 673952, 75471, '<td valign="top">This is cute =)</td>', 'This is cute =)', '2008-04-30 22:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669156, 674530, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a bit harsh, but I like your idea and all the different colors.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a bit harsh, but I like your idea and all the different colors.', '2008-04-30 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669157, 674420, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cute and very well done. Good lighting, colors contrast and composition. Best of luck in the challenge. One of the best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Very cute and very well done. Good lighting, colors contrast and composition. Best of luck in the challenge. One of the best I''ve seen so far.', '2008-04-30 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669159, 674527, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like all the different fruits and colors. The glass is cool too. For me, if the background were different - perhaps a good solid black, the colors of the fruit would pop even more.</td>', 'I like all the different fruits and colors. The glass is cool too. For me, if the background were different - perhaps a good solid black, the colors of the fruit would pop even more.', '2008-04-30 22:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669161, 674331, 75471, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the back half of the sandwich in focus also. I feel like all I see is the fruit. It looks very yummy and it has good colors and texture.</td>', 'I would like to see the back half of the sandwich in focus also. I feel like all I see is the fruit. It looks very yummy and it has good colors and texture.', '2008-04-30 22:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669164, 674366, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if the lighting were a bit brighter and a little bit sharper focus, I would have scored it higher. I do like the tight composition and the contrasting colors.</td>', 'For me, if the lighting were a bit brighter and a little bit sharper focus, I would have scored it higher. I do like the tight composition and the contrasting colors.', '2008-04-30 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669166, 674388, 75471, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2008-04-30 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669167, 674431, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great concept and good title. For me, the background doesn''t really do much to add to your image, but otherwise I really like it.</td>', 'Great concept and good title. For me, the background doesn''t really do much to add to your image, but otherwise I really like it.', '2008-04-30 22:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669168, 674414, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and black background. The lighting seems a bit...off as the white of the rice and meat seems a bit on the yellow side.</td>', 'I like the composition and black background. The lighting seems a bit...off as the white of the rice and meat seems a bit on the yellow side.', '2008-04-30 22:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669170, 674225, 41675, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, studio dpc quality. The tomato looks so clean and perfectly round it looks more like a child''s rubber ball than a tomato.</td>', 'Crisp, clean, studio dpc quality. The tomato looks so clean and perfectly round it looks more like a child''s rubber ball than a tomato.', '2008-04-30 22:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
