(4669667, 674530, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice healthy specimens which is important, and you have captured the colours nice and vibrantly. I feel though that showing what they are sitting on in the bottom left side takes away from it somewhat. Maybe if it was cropped out, or something like a plain black plate, it would clean it up a bit. Another thing I notice is a couple of harsh shadows amoung the peppers. Softer lighting would be ideal, but if you had used a black surface, they wouldn''t have shown up as much.  Not bad though.</td>', 'Nice healthy specimens which is important, and you have captured the colours nice and vibrantly. I feel though that showing what they are sitting on in the bottom left side takes away from it somewhat. Maybe if it was cropped out, or something like a plain black plate, it would clean it up a bit. Another thing I notice is a couple of harsh shadows amoung the peppers. Softer lighting would be ideal, but if you had used a black surface, they wouldn''t have shown up as much.  Not bad though.', '2008-05-01 01:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4669688, 674173, 90380, '<td valign="top">Because the pepper is not fresh and rather dried out, it takes away from the healthy image you are trying to portray. Use a fresh new veggie (and maybe a bit brighter lighting) and you''ve got yourself a very nice photo. You did compose it nicely. :-)</td>', 'Because the pepper is not fresh and rather dried out, it takes away from the healthy image you are trying to portray. Use a fresh new veggie (and maybe a bit brighter lighting) and you''ve got yourself a very nice photo. You did compose it nicely. :-)', '2008-05-01 01:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
