(4670770, 673794, 33769, '<td valign="top">Healthy-for certian, I can see this in a magazine in my mind beside a recipe;  I gave it a high score even tho I dislike fish (and don''t find fish-heads in my food very yummy) :) :-D its an artistic shot-which is what the challenge is all about! :)  I like your play on shadows, and the darkness/light with the rice  in the background...  I like the grain in the background of the wood-and wonder if playing wtih the levels some more might have made this image pop more?  (just becase its not something I''d -eat- doesn''t mean its not a cool shot/idea!) :)  the reflection inside the bowl does pull my eye out of the image but the circle keeps it focused on the main subject... -nicely captured! :) *look forward to seeing if you post a recipe since other family members of mine love fish!* :)</td>', 'Healthy-for certian, I can see this in a magazine in my mind beside a recipe;  I gave it a high score even tho I dislike fish (and don''t find fish-heads in my food very yummy) :) :-D its an artistic shot-which is what the challenge is all about! :)  I like your play on shadows, and the darkness/light with the rice  in the background...  I like the grain in the background of the wood-and wonder if playing wtih the levels some more might have made this image pop more?  (just becase its not something I''d -eat- doesn''t mean its not a cool shot/idea!) :)  the reflection inside the bowl does pull my eye out of the image but the circle keeps it focused on the main subject... -nicely captured! :) *look forward to seeing if you post a recipe since other family members of mine love fish!* :)', '2008-05-01 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670771, 672726, 89423, '<td valign="top">A little to cluttered</td>', 'A little to cluttered', '2008-05-01 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
