(4670780, 672389, 33769, '<td valign="top">YUMM, and I don''t even know what soy is! *L*  :) (10) nice composition, I like the diffrent shapes captured here, and the textures you used  I look forward to seeing if you post a recipe! :)</td>', 'YUMM, and I don''t even know what soy is! *L*  :) (10) nice composition, I like the diffrent shapes captured here, and the textures you used  I look forward to seeing if you post a recipe! :)', '2008-05-01 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670787, 674393, 33769, '<td valign="top">YEP!  very yummy-meets the challenge and I kind of feel like leaning forward and eating... (my screen! darn...) *LOL*  - simple, beautiful use of red and green/spices on a very clean background, that fork just makes me want to bite down and devour the food on it! :)  well captured! :) (10) :)</td>', 'YEP!  very yummy-meets the challenge and I kind of feel like leaning forward and eating... (my screen! darn...) *LOL*  - simple, beautiful use of red and green/spices on a very clean background, that fork just makes me want to bite down and devour the food on it! :)  well captured! :) (10) :)', '2008-05-01 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670789, 673825, 33769, '<td valign="top">whatever that is it looks yummy! :) (chicken and salad?) - I ignore titles anyway :) great capture!! LOVE the feeling of it-like a print ad for some yummy new menue item! :) (10)</td>', 'whatever that is it looks yummy! :) (chicken and salad?) - I ignore titles anyway :) great capture!! LOVE the feeling of it-like a print ad for some yummy new menue item! :) (10)', '2008-05-01 11:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670799, 673648, 33769, '<td valign="top">OK- I honestly would not eat that if it was put infront of me :) but I don''t try new things and that''s oK it works for me *LOL* (and I don''t like fish but I don''t score down for what I like or dislike) ;) the composition is lovely, the play of circles is great! :) I like how you have the composition in a pan which looks like a plate at first glance! :)  I enjoy the off-set of the image and slight slant you created...there are some wonderful shapes and creative things going on- and I can see this easily being part of a magazine shot with a recipe; so...drumm roll pleaseee..... (10) :) *see some of us can look past our personal dislikes or aversions ;) :-D goodluck!! :)</td>', 'OK- I honestly would not eat that if it was put infront of me :) but I don''t try new things and that''s oK it works for me *LOL* (and I don''t like fish but I don''t score down for what I like or dislike) ;) the composition is lovely, the play of circles is great! :) I like how you have the composition in a pan which looks like a plate at first glance! :)  I enjoy the off-set of the image and slight slant you created...there are some wonderful shapes and creative things going on- and I can see this easily being part of a magazine shot with a recipe; so...drumm roll pleaseee..... (10) :) *see some of us can look past our personal dislikes or aversions ;) :-D goodluck!! :)', '2008-05-01 11:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670807, 674181, 33769, '<td valign="top">YUMMY!!! and I love your choice of a dark backround to compliment the colors of the fruit!! :)  ok- now i''m hungry; beautiful composition too :) HIGH SCORE! :)  now i''m off to find myself some yummy fruit...</td>', 'YUMMY!!! and I love your choice of a dark backround to compliment the colors of the fruit!! :)  ok- now i''m hungry; beautiful composition too :) HIGH SCORE! :)  now i''m off to find myself some yummy fruit...', '2008-05-01 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
