(4670984, 673629, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  This is a tough one.  The colors work well together (black/blue/orangy brown).  Probably tough to do, but this would be a lot stronger presentation if the cup was in the focal plane too.  The coffee needs stirring (creamer is blotching up).  All JMO of course.  :-)   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  This is a tough one.  The colors work well together (black/blue/orangy brown).  Probably tough to do, but this would be a lot stronger presentation if the cup was in the focal plane too.  The coffee needs stirring (creamer is blotching up).  All JMO of course.  :-)   Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-01 11:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4670993, 674369, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones.  Great DOF and bg OOF item.  Exposure &amp; lighting control is perfect.  Very well done!</td>', 'Wonderful tones.  Great DOF and bg OOF item.  Exposure & lighting control is perfect.  Very well done!', '2008-05-01 11:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
