(4671001, 672726, 30049, '<td valign="top">So much to take in!  Certainly plenty of healthy food in this image.  :-)  Not quite sure where to settle in with this, which tells me it may be too busy...</td>', 'So much to take in!  Certainly plenty of healthy food in this image.  :-)  Not quite sure where to settle in with this, which tells me it may be too busy...', '2008-05-01 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
