(4671013, 674178, 674, '<td valign="top">There is not enough sharpness in this to make the contrast stand out. the image appears a bit flat!</td>', 'There is not enough sharpness in this to make the contrast stand out. the image appears a bit flat!', '2008-05-01 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
