(4671544, 673230, 56109, '<td valign="top">I think if this was the first time I was seeing this image it would have had a more powerful impact on me. However, because a similar image can be seen here <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=467042" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/632/120/467042.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/632/120/467042.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/632/120/467042.jpg"/></a>, and I actually find the original a much better photo, this is kind of a turn off. I''m all for copying an idea and putting your own spin on it, but if you do that then you have to make it better IMO. I liked the leaf in the first one, I preferred that the image was centered, the colored background gave it a more "outdoorsy" feel, and with this picture there is a small shadow to the left that I find distracting. I do think it''s a good attempt and it''s interesting to see an apple instead of an orange, and with a little more effort I think you would have pulled it off, but overall it looses some points for me because it didn''t meet the expectations of the previous image.</td>', 'I think if this was the first time I was seeing this image it would have had a more powerful impact on me. However, because a similar image can be seen here , and I actually find the original a much better photo, this is kind of a turn off. I''m all for copying an idea and putting your own spin on it, but if you do that then you have to make it better IMO. I liked the leaf in the first one, I preferred that the image was centered, the colored background gave it a more "outdoorsy" feel, and with this picture there is a small shadow to the left that I find distracting. I do think it''s a good attempt and it''s interesting to see an apple instead of an orange, and with a little more effort I think you would have pulled it off, but overall it looses some points for me because it didn''t meet the expectations of the previous image.', '2008-05-01 14:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
