(4676366, 673877, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh and the composition feels a bit off-centered to me. I do like all the green!</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh and the composition feels a bit off-centered to me. I do like all the green!', '2008-05-03 01:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676369, 673746, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice, but would have been better with all the orange in the frame. I do like how it is the often-used "splash" theme but it has a nice take to it - more raw, not "perfect" lighting... it feels more real and fresh to me and I like it.</td>', 'Nice, but would have been better with all the orange in the frame. I do like how it is the often-used "splash" theme but it has a nice take to it - more raw, not "perfect" lighting... it feels more real and fresh to me and I like it.', '2008-05-03 01:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676371, 674076, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like too much empty space to me, and I would have prefered the apple to look more round. I like the colors and the focus - definitely can see a lot of great detail!</td>', 'Seems like too much empty space to me, and I would have prefered the apple to look more round. I like the colors and the focus - definitely can see a lot of great detail!', '2008-05-03 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676376, 674209, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm, I wouldn''t have thought of a mushroom as healthy food, but I think you''re right!  The title seems a bit cheesy to me. As for the image itself, it is of course fantastic. I love the DOF, the detail, the lighting, and the rich color. Only negative things are the abnormal spot at the right center, and right above that there are some spots - would be nice to clone them out but obviously can''t in a basic challenge. I think if you did that, though, this would make an awesome print or something... I really like it a lot. Great job!</td>', 'Hm, I wouldn''t have thought of a mushroom as healthy food, but I think you''re right!  The title seems a bit cheesy to me. As for the image itself, it is of course fantastic. I love the DOF, the detail, the lighting, and the rich color. Only negative things are the abnormal spot at the right center, and right above that there are some spots - would be nice to clone them out but obviously can''t in a basic challenge. I think if you did that, though, this would make an awesome print or something... I really like it a lot. Great job!', '2008-05-03 01:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676379, 674366, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like it! Great to see something in its "natural habitat". Composition is great and I love the vibrant colors. It does look oversharpened and not in focus, though, and that will probably pull down your score significantly.  In any case, there''s something about this image, probably the colors, that honestly makes me happy! Yay! :-D</td>', 'I like it! Great to see something in its "natural habitat". Composition is great and I love the vibrant colors. It does look oversharpened and not in focus, though, and that will probably pull down your score significantly.  In any case, there''s something about this image, probably the colors, that honestly makes me happy! Yay! :-D', '2008-05-03 01:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676383, 674393, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the presentation of the food, with the spices and dashes of red color - makes it look really appealing.</td>', 'I love the presentation of the food, with the spices and dashes of red color - makes it look really appealing.', '2008-05-03 01:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676385, 672754, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of the pink background, but otherwise I like this.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of the pink background, but otherwise I like this.', '2008-05-03 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676387, 674024, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oooh, reminds me of fishing with my dad.  I don''t think this will meet the challenge for a lot of people, though.  In any case, I think it''s a very neat looking image.</td>', 'Oooh, reminds me of fishing with my dad.  I don''t think this will meet the challenge for a lot of people, though.  In any case, I think it''s a very neat looking image.', '2008-05-03 01:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676391, 673848, 53316, '<td valign="top">Maybe a TINY bit too dark - I just wish I could see the knife a little better.  However, I think the contrast overall is great! I also love the perspective, and the differing sizes of the peppers. Very creative and fun looking image!</td>', 'Maybe a TINY bit too dark - I just wish I could see the knife a little better.  However, I think the contrast overall is great! I also love the perspective, and the differing sizes of the peppers. Very creative and fun looking image!', '2008-05-03 01:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676395, 673648, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well for goodness sake. I think this is the most wonderful looking bit of food I''ve ever seen. You did a fantastic job!! This should totally go in a health food magazine for sure. I love the lighting and the colors, and the composition is just great. Yay!</td>', 'Well for goodness sake. I think this is the most wonderful looking bit of food I''ve ever seen. You did a fantastic job!! This should totally go in a health food magazine for sure. I love the lighting and the colors, and the composition is just great. Yay!', '2008-05-03 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
