(4677623, 674420, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  So nice to see a bright backdrop instead of stark white.  DOF on the tape measure works well.  Kind of an ugly pair though with all the brown --- taste good though!</td>', 'Very nice.  So nice to see a bright backdrop instead of stark white.  DOF on the tape measure works well.  Kind of an ugly pair though with all the brown --- taste good though!', '2008-05-03 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
