(4677628, 673648, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Might be one (or two) many items on the table that keep diverting the eye from the main subject.</td>', 'Very nice.  Might be one (or two) many items on the table that keep diverting the eye from the main subject.', '2008-05-03 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4677629, 674391, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The water might be more distraction than addition on this one.  It morphs the roundneess of the tomato into a oblong shape.</td>', 'Very nice.  The water might be more distraction than addition on this one.  It morphs the roundneess of the tomato into a oblong shape.', '2008-05-03 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4677632, 674212, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  Love how it is frozen.  The title hurt my eyes.  You mixed an comma, exclamation point,  all caps, and parenthesies in only 6 words.  I would try "Soda Bad, Water Good" or "Water is Healthy, Soda is Not" or even just "Stop Drinking Soda".</td>', 'Cool photo.  Love how it is frozen.  The title hurt my eyes.  You mixed an comma, exclamation point,  all caps, and parenthesies in only 6 words.  I would try "Soda Bad, Water Good" or "Water is Healthy, Soda is Not" or even just "Stop Drinking Soda".', '2008-05-03 16:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
