(4677843, 674404, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not voting just commenting.  Lighting is nice, colors are appealing.  Composition leads to parts of the subject being cut off and the dof should get the entirety of the subject in focus imo.</td>', 'Not voting just commenting.  Lighting is nice, colors are appealing.  Composition leads to parts of the subject being cut off and the dof should get the entirety of the subject in focus imo.', '2008-05-03 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
