(4681524, 674431, 89547, '<td valign="top">Good idea, with good lines that lead throughout the photo.</td>', 'Good idea, with good lines that lead throughout the photo.', '2008-05-05 11:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681525, 673046, 89547, '<td valign="top">Great close detail and crispness of the photo. Good shapes in the wings.</td>', 'Great close detail and crispness of the photo. Good shapes in the wings.', '2008-05-05 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681528, 673631, 89547, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up, with good detail.</td>', 'Nice close-up, with good detail.', '2008-05-05 11:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681531, 673531, 89547, '<td valign="top">Nice lines creat with good movement.</td>', 'Nice lines creat with good movement.', '2008-05-05 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681532, 674420, 89547, '<td valign="top">Great photo, with good lines and nice composition.</td>', 'Great photo, with good lines and nice composition.', '2008-05-05 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681539, 674180, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure what food this is.  It''s interesting...kinda "blobish".  I think the textures are too melded to really pull this off as a macro/closeup.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Not sure what food this is.  It''s interesting...kinda "blobish".  I think the textures are too melded to really pull this off as a macro/closeup.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2008-05-05 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681541, 674527, 30049, '<td valign="top">You have the right ingredients.  The use of flash (looks like anyway) is really dampening any artistic possibilities here IMO.  Lots of glare on the glass and the background is all greyed out and appears underexposed.  Compositionally it''s a little static with the centered positioning of the subject.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You have the right ingredients.  The use of flash (looks like anyway) is really dampening any artistic possibilities here IMO.  Lots of glare on the glass and the background is all greyed out and appears underexposed.  Compositionally it''s a little static with the centered positioning of the subject.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-05 11:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681544, 672725, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun, if not cliche-ish.  I take it your emphasis is on the refraction in the water droplet?  While working on that I think the main part of the fruit became a little neglected in DOF.  What gives me this impression is the "hairs" of the skin are well focused and show good detail, but the face of the fruit is just off a tad.  Just some observations, and obviously just one person''s opinion.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is fun, if not cliche-ish.  I take it your emphasis is on the refraction in the water droplet?  While working on that I think the main part of the fruit became a little neglected in DOF.  What gives me this impression is the "hairs" of the skin are well focused and show good detail, but the face of the fruit is just off a tad.  Just some observations, and obviously just one person''s opinion.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-05 11:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681809, 674547, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the idea (LOVE smoothies BTW)...however, the image seems like it could use a little sharpening, especially the upper part of the strawberry.  The composition is put together nicely, as it is very well balanced.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea (LOVE smoothies BTW)...however, the image seems like it could use a little sharpening, especially the upper part of the strawberry.  The composition is put together nicely, as it is very well balanced.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-05 13:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681819, 673039, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly some healthy food there.  :-)  Lighting is a bit harsh.  Try using a reflector (white poster board works well) to get fill light and eliminate the glare.  The big piece of lettuce in the upper right is overwhelming the image.  All JMO of course.  :-D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Certainly some healthy food there.  :-)  Lighting is a bit harsh.  Try using a reflector (white poster board works well) to get fill light and eliminate the glare.  The big piece of lettuce in the upper right is overwhelming the image.  All JMO of course.  :-D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-05 13:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
