(4683042, 673125, 89424, '<td valign="top">This picture it wrong, but funny. The dog is very cute but you would benefit from a larger size.</td>', 'This picture it wrong, but funny. The dog is very cute but you would benefit from a larger size.', '2008-05-05 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
