(4683057, 673039, 89424, '<td valign="top">This photograph has nice highlihgts but the cucumbers have a little too much shine to them. The way the vegatables fill the photo is good too.</td>', 'This photograph has nice highlihgts but the cucumbers have a little too much shine to them. The way the vegatables fill the photo is good too.', '2008-05-05 23:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683060, 674150, 89424, '<td valign="top">This photograph is titled "eggs" but the focus is on the candle and it''s a little distracting.</td>', 'This photograph is titled "eggs" but the focus is on the candle and it''s a little distracting.', '2008-05-05 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683064, 674024, 89424, '<td valign="top">The lighting of this photograph is borderline very good or very bad. The fish is also a little blurry.</td>', 'The lighting of this photograph is borderline very good or very bad. The fish is also a little blurry.', '2008-05-05 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683069, 673191, 89424, '<td valign="top">There is another picture like this in this challange and i love them both. The balance of positive space and negative space is bery beneficial to the picture, but the reflection of the droplets near the stem of the apple make the dropletts look like they are something other than water.</td>', 'There is another picture like this in this challange and i love them both. The balance of positive space and negative space is bery beneficial to the picture, but the reflection of the droplets near the stem of the apple make the dropletts look like they are something other than water.', '2008-05-05 23:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683114, 673756, 34255, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail.</td>', 'Great lighting and detail.', '2008-05-05 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683216, 674192, 72670, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you are trying to accomplish here. Are those pills? or what are they? If the emphasis is on the tomato, then just show the tomato without distractions in good lighting and make the colour of the tomato pop off the page. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Not sure what you are trying to accomplish here. Are those pills? or what are they? If the emphasis is on the tomato, then just show the tomato without distractions in good lighting and make the colour of the tomato pop off the page. Just my opinion.', '2008-05-06 00:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683223, 674323, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour and clear drops. Good shot.</td>', 'Very nice colour and clear drops. Good shot.', '2008-05-06 00:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683232, 674404, 72670, '<td valign="top">Good work here. Almost magazine worthy. Just my opinion..I would have shot without the distracting background. Just some backlighting from a window and a slightly lower and tighter crop. Also have the focus on the front corner of the entree. All that said I still like the effort.7</td>', 'Good work here. Almost magazine worthy. Just my opinion..I would have shot without the distracting background. Just some backlighting from a window and a slightly lower and tighter crop. Also have the focus on the front corner of the entree. All that said I still like the effort.7', '2008-05-06 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683240, 674518, 72670, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good elements. Nice lighting,The props in the back and the colours.The only nitpik is the focus is on the left side of the dish. I would have preferred the focus on the centre pieces in the salad. IMO 8</td>', 'Nice. Good elements. Nice lighting,The props in the back and the colours.The only nitpik is the focus is on the left side of the dish. I would have preferred the focus on the centre pieces in the salad. IMO 8', '2008-05-06 00:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683242, 672405, 72670, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean. No distractions. I like it a lot. Just a little more light on the table, above the forks to make it more like the other side would of been nice.9 from me</td>', 'Nice and clean. No distractions. I like it a lot. Just a little more light on the table, above the forks to make it more like the other side would of been nice.9 from me', '2008-05-06 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683247, 674226, 72670, '<td valign="top">nice touch of humour. good job!</td>', 'nice touch of humour. good job!', '2008-05-06 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683251, 673648, 72670, '<td valign="top">Did you cut this out of a magazine? Cause this is excellent!! Great colours that pop off the page,nice lighting, composition is excellent and focus is spot on. 10 ..compliments to the chef.</td>', 'Did you cut this out of a magazine? Cause this is excellent!! Great colours that pop off the page,nice lighting, composition is excellent and focus is spot on. 10 ..compliments to the chef.', '2008-05-06 00:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683255, 673054, 72670, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2008-05-06 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683287, 673932, 66398, '<td valign="top">Putting a fill light on the left would fill in the shadows a little and your key light is pretty hard. You could soften it up a little with a diffusion like maybe some wax paper and you''d still have some nice highlights that are a little softer. Nice composition and choice of colorful healthy food.</td>', 'Putting a fill light on the left would fill in the shadows a little and your key light is pretty hard. You could soften it up a little with a diffusion like maybe some wax paper and you''d still have some nice highlights that are a little softer. Nice composition and choice of colorful healthy food.', '2008-05-06 00:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
