(4685870, 674225, 34462, '<td valign="top">Holy Mackerel, it''s you again. What a wonderful photo. It is so cool that you really are in your element right now.</td>', 'Holy Mackerel, it''s you again. What a wonderful photo. It is so cool that you really are in your element right now.', '2008-05-07 01:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685886, 674391, 91585, '<td valign="top">I thought this shot was brilliant.  Using the sun to backlight and produce the halos around the fruit, and still getting the right amount of light on the subject, wow.  And then to get it all sharp, nice job.</td>', 'I thought this shot was brilliant.  Using the sun to backlight and produce the halos around the fruit, and still getting the right amount of light on the subject, wow.  And then to get it all sharp, nice job.', '2008-05-07 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685898, 673554, 84520, '<td valign="top">I''m going to disagree with alot of the previous comments and say that the shadow is great.  It does a great job of anchoring the image and it rounds out the composition.  However, if you''re including it, it needs to have a crisper definition, or have a greater diffusion of contrast along the edges.  This is an easy top ten if the depth of focus extended from the bottom of the image to the end of those parsley leaves in the back.  For what it''s worth, you got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I''m going to disagree with alot of the previous comments and say that the shadow is great.  It does a great job of anchoring the image and it rounds out the composition.  However, if you''re including it, it needs to have a crisper definition, or have a greater diffusion of contrast along the edges.  This is an easy top ten if the depth of focus extended from the bottom of the image to the end of those parsley leaves in the back.  For what it''s worth, you got a 7 from me.', '2008-05-07 01:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685912, 674226, 78516, '<td valign="top">Wow, I figured that you must have used a fake fish or something! Now knowing that it was real, it''s even more deserving of the blue. That''s a tough shot to get! Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, I figured that you must have used a fake fish or something! Now knowing that it was real, it''s even more deserving of the blue. That''s a tough shot to get! Congrats!', '2008-05-07 01:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685924, 673300, 34462, '<td valign="top">You sure got folks commenting on this one Jon. I think it looks like an ovum with spermatozoa trying to get inside, but then that would take a really big macro lens.</td>', 'You sure got folks commenting on this one Jon. I think it looks like an ovum with spermatozoa trying to get inside, but then that would take a really big macro lens.', '2008-05-07 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685931, 673648, 69368, '<td valign="top">only place 12?! Cant''t believe; it''s underrated....</td>', 'only place 12?! Cant''t believe; it''s underrated....', '2008-05-07 01:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685933, 672754, 70369, '<td valign="top">another awesome finish for you.. Congrats !!!</td>', 'another awesome finish for you.. Congrats !!!', '2008-05-07 01:57:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685967, 673300, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned that so many commenters couldn''t tell what this was. Do these people not pay attention to the food they eat? And I think you deserved a MUCH higher score. This is a wonderfully creative take on the challenge theme. I scored this one tied with the photo that took second place.</td>', 'I''m stunned that so many commenters couldn''t tell what this was. Do these people not pay attention to the food they eat? And I think you deserved a MUCH higher score. This is a wonderfully creative take on the challenge theme. I scored this one tied with the photo that took second place.', '2008-05-07 02:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685969, 673648, 49109, '<td valign="top">Man, this is the most underrated shot ever, thought it would get at least a high 7ish score. What''s bothering me most is that you lost against all those cliché shots</td>', 'Man, this is the most underrated shot ever, thought it would get at least a high 7ish score. What''s bothering me most is that you lost against all those cliché shots', '2008-05-07 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685988, 674225, 80608, '<td valign="top">Wow... Another ribbon...<br/>Knew this picture was going to beat me...I too love this pic.<br/>Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Wow... Another ribbon...Knew this picture was going to beat me...I too love this pic.Congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-05-07 02:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685991, 674226, 80608, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first Blue!</td>', 'Congrats on your first Blue!', '2008-05-07 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686048, 674226, 82503, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad to see this winning, great shot! <br/> <br/>I wanted to shoot a picture for an ad in Switzerland, also using a goldfish in such a classic goldfish bowl. When I went into a pet shop to get the fish, the people there were outraged and told me that keeping goldfish in a bowl had become illegal (in Switzerland). You need a big aquarium with proper aeration, etc. and you''re not allowed to have a single fish, they need to have companions. I told the sales person the fish would just be in the bowl for a few minutes, but that just got her more upset. Well, maybe I''ll have to do it in a different country because people just expect goldfish to be in a bowl like that, it''s the image we all have of them. However, I would first like to try and find out if being in a bowl really is such a horrible experience for them...</td>', 'I''m so glad to see this winning, great shot!  I wanted to shoot a picture for an ad in Switzerland, also using a goldfish in such a classic goldfish bowl. When I went into a pet shop to get the fish, the people there were outraged and told me that keeping goldfish in a bowl had become illegal (in Switzerland). You need a big aquarium with proper aeration, etc. and you''re not allowed to have a single fish, they need to have companions. I told the sales person the fish would just be in the bowl for a few minutes, but that just got her more upset. Well, maybe I''ll have to do it in a different country because people just expect goldfish to be in a bowl like that, it''s the image we all have of them. However, I would first like to try and find out if being in a bowl really is such a horrible experience for them...', '2008-05-07 02:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686051, 673230, 80608, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I love this pciture and it looks cool!<br/>I just got lucky winning you by 0.01.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-07 09:18:30.</i></td>', 'Nice shot! I love this pciture and it looks cool!I just got lucky winning you by 0.01.', '2008-05-07 03:01:01.000000', '2008-05-07 10:18:30.000000', 0),
(4686087, 674226, 16230, '<td valign="top">I''m glad all the hard work paid off for you. Congratulations!</td>', 'I''m glad all the hard work paid off for you. Congratulations!', '2008-05-07 03:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686130, 674225, 46885, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. It makes a great stock pix, but it''s a bit too sterile for my liking - the lighting on the tomato is way too flat, making it look a bit plastic. But given the job I''d probably won''t make it half as good, so - good job, again.</td>', 'Congratulations. It makes a great stock pix, but it''s a bit too sterile for my liking - the lighting on the tomato is way too flat, making it look a bit plastic. But given the job I''d probably won''t make it half as good, so - good job, again.', '2008-05-07 04:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
