(4686393, 673054, 25095, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments everyone, I''m glad it made so many laugh...yes this is me, I had to run back and forth to the camera since I don''t have a remote.  lol I''m sure it would have been quite a scene if anyone had been watching.<br/> <br/>in reply to some of the comments...<br/> <br/>-the reason there isn''t more cereal in the box is because it is supposed to represent that I just got done eating it and that is why I''m now on the toilet.<br/> <br/>-I do think the quality could be better, and probably was before I tried to post process it on a monitor that is old and apparently too dark...sorry about that.  I was also shooting in a room with fluorescent lights and ugly yellowish walls and couldn''t get a pleasent white balance.  (wow just looked...21 1 votes? I didn''t think it was THAT bad, oh well).  With a better quality shot I don''t see why a company wouldn''t use it in an advertisement, they like humor too, maybe with just a toilet and no one on it would be better.<br/> <br/>-Sorry about the distracting Coca-Cola bowl, it''s all I had to work with.<br/> <br/>On the plus side, my current challenge is only 6 hours old and doing much better than this did.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments everyone, I''m glad it made so many laugh...yes this is me, I had to run back and forth to the camera since I don''t have a remote.  lol I''m sure it would have been quite a scene if anyone had been watching. in reply to some of the comments... -the reason there isn''t more cereal in the box is because it is supposed to represent that I just got done eating it and that is why I''m now on the toilet. -I do think the quality could be better, and probably was before I tried to post process it on a monitor that is old and apparently too dark...sorry about that.  I was also shooting in a room with fluorescent lights and ugly yellowish walls and couldn''t get a pleasent white balance.  (wow just looked...21 1 votes? I didn''t think it was THAT bad, oh well).  With a better quality shot I don''t see why a company wouldn''t use it in an advertisement, they like humor too, maybe with just a toilet and no one on it would be better. -Sorry about the distracting Coca-Cola bowl, it''s all I had to work with. On the plus side, my current challenge is only 6 hours old and doing much better than this did. ', '2008-05-07 07:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
