(4687526, 673054, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hi Scott, this shot is too funny! I can''t believe it did so poorly. Some people just don''t have a sense of humor and/or really take the challenge description too literally. Anyways, even with all the minor technical flaws this is a great photo and I definitely think it could appear in a food magazine, or any magazine as an advert.<br/>As you can see from <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=676990" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> I meant to give you this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670651" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg"/></a> but I forgot.</td>', 'Hi Scott, this shot is too funny! I can''t believe it did so poorly. Some people just don''t have a sense of humor and/or really take the challenge description too literally. Anyways, even with all the minor technical flaws this is a great photo and I definitely think it could appear in a food magazine, or any magazine as an advert.As you can see from here I meant to give you this  but I forgot.', '2008-05-07 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4687572, 674226, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hi Terri, as you can see from <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=676990" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> I meant to give you this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670652" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg"/></a> (not that you need it since you got a real ribbon) but I forgot. <br/>I know how hard it is to shoot goldfish believe me I''ve tried with my daughter''s bubblecheek goldfish. You did an excellent job with impeccable timing!<br/> <br/><i>Edit: Oops, sorry I typo''d the wrong color ribbon at first. Fixed it now ;)</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-07 16:05:51.</i></td>', 'Hi Terri, as you can see from here I meant to give you this  (not that you need it since you got a real ribbon) but I forgot. I know how hard it is to shoot goldfish believe me I''ve tried with my daughter''s bubblecheek goldfish. You did an excellent job with impeccable timing! Edit: Oops, sorry I typo''d the wrong color ribbon at first. Fixed it now ;)', '2008-05-07 15:59:42.000000', '2008-05-07 17:05:51.000000', 0),
