(4687854, 672389, 53964, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, putting the main dish in focus and the sides out, but still identifable. It looks very appealing to me, and much more difficult to compose and shoot than a single item, such as a piece of fruit.<br/>Maybe the sauce isn''t sparkling, as you say, but it looks exactly as it should look for that dish :)</td>', 'I like the DOF, putting the main dish in focus and the sides out, but still identifable. It looks very appealing to me, and much more difficult to compose and shoot than a single item, such as a piece of fruit.Maybe the sauce isn''t sparkling, as you say, but it looks exactly as it should look for that dish :)', '2008-05-07 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4687866, 674393, 33068, '<td valign="top">Should have been in the top five.  Love it.<br/> <br/>I just noticed your settings.  ISO 1600 with 15 sec exposure?  WHOA!  I don''t see any grain at all.   VERY NICE....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-07 16:39:28.</i></td>', 'Should have been in the top five.  Love it. I just noticed your settings.  ISO 1600 with 15 sec exposure?  WHOA!  I don''t see any grain at all.   VERY NICE....', '2008-05-07 17:38:19.000000', '2008-05-07 17:39:28.000000', 0),
